# Logs are operational, not data
batch.log
rechunk.log
rerun.log

# Model comparison runs are exploratory, not canonical output
model-compare/

# variants/ is NOT ignored - it IS canonical and tracked. ADR 0039 specifies
# variants/{record}/{model}.{prompt_sha8}.yaml as the variant store layout, and a
# specified location in a data repo is repo membership. It went untracked by
# oversight, not decision: one `git clean -fd` would have destroyed the entire
# input to the model-choice programme, re-creatable only by re-spending model
# allowance. Stated here explicitly so the contrast with model-compare/ above
# reads as a decision rather than an absence.
